<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 26, 2004 :: Holy Crap am I a slacker!</div><p>Finally.. finally! We find Manaetic Behemoth up AND get there before anyone else. No pictures were taken, of course, since he doesn't get to live long. Edit: I lied, Parn took a picture as we were setting up. <br /><br /><img alt="" hspace="0" src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/mb_01.jpg" align="baseline" border="0" /></p><p>Loot grats to Kleria on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/coil_twisted_platinum_wire.jpeg">Coil of Twisted Platinum Wire</a> and Vaea on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowing_steel_shim.jpg">Glowing Steel Shim</a>!  </p><p>Grats Dawneylee on completing your <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/nature_walkers_scimitar.jpg">Nature Walker's Scimitar</a>!<br />Grats Shatta on completing your <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler of Nem Ankh</a>!</p><p>Grats Haitful on 65 and Fury, our first Fury in the guild!<br />Lots of other level updates I've missed.. will try to fill in here. Apologies to those not listed.. I still love you!</p><p>Some raid loots since the last time I updated. <br />Zelcon on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/tunic_of_the_khati_sha.jpg">Tunic of Khati Sha</a>!<br />Schena and Tellie on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/glowingorbofthestormwatcher.jpg">Glowing Orb of the Stormwatcher</a>!<br />Sindall on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/cap_drowned_souls.jpg">Cap of Drowned Souls</a>!<br />Tempys on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/stormriders_signet.jpg">Stormrider's Signet</a>!<br />Kelnya on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/gargoyle_talon.jpg">Gargoyle Talon</a>! (thanks RD who didn't need for letting him come loot it)<br />Reide and Grajin on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</a>!<br />Lushissx on the greed roll for Plate Ornate Breastplate Mold!<br />Dorina on the greed roll for Ornate Leather Tunic pattern!<br />Balut on the greed roll for Ornate Chain Tunic pattern!<br />Colwn on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</a>! <br />Grellk on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/blackbladeoftherain.jpe">Blackblade of the Rain</a> and <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Twice_Forged_Steel_Bulwark.gif">Twice Forged Steel Bulwark</a>!<br />Arwa on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/talisman_burrower.gif">Talisman of the Burrower</a>!<br />Emmajo on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Wormhusk_Harness.jpg">Wormhusk Harness</a>!</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jul 4, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 15, 2004 :: Filling in the holes... :)</div><P>Like Wonderbuns said, we finished up Sleeper's Tomb. First time seeing ancients, and no deaths (aside from theirs). And let me tell you.. that Kildrukaun the Ancient is a seriously long fight with 18 people... mostly knights. </P>
<P>It was 1 handed blunt day on the prismatic, and the clerics are all set to proc avatar now.. phew! We got three more people all the items for that <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/bladesouls_spiritual_diadem.jpg">Spiritual Diadum</A> quest.. grats Meeka, Balut and Mahrsan. And the Ancients dropped some toys. </P>
<P>DWARVES! Grats Parnicail and Kithik on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/besmirchedmask.jpg">Besmirched Mask of Conception</A>, Ceyria and Sindall both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/fasciasecundae.gif">Fascia Secundae</A>, Thayet on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/tenuousdragonscaleslippers.gif">Teneous Dragonscale Slippers</A>, we CoH'd Emanci down to loot some fistwraps and&nbsp;a second set rotted. And banks or rot gods got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Clandestine_Veil_of_MRata.jpg">Clandestine Veil of M'Rata</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/clawed_coat_tyro.JPG">Clawed Coat of Tyro</A>, a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/despondentshroud.jpg">Despondant Shroud</A>&nbsp;and another pair of those slippers. Feel like I'm forgetting something. I forgot to take a picture of the first dead ancient, but I remembered on the last three!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://www.myschief.com/files/userfiles/meeka/stancients.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>We also grabbed Grummus again and flagged a few more people this time. Grats Lumalie on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/diseasedratskinmask.gif">Diseased Ratskin Mask</A> and Traver on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/runed_lance_gryme.gif">Runed Lance of Grymme</A>. </P>
<P>Not only did Bryte finally get his snakey stick (thanks to the patch fixing that combine bug), but Lairiel finally got a SEoC and grabbed his <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=3637">Earthcaller</A>! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 14, 2004 :: Some More catchup!</div><P>Well its been a busy week!! We finally got around to clearing Sleepers Tomb, and getting more folks their quest pieces! </P>
<P>The following people have been leveling without permission. I shall have to group them soon to help them get back in line .. ;)</P>
<P>Tylokki - 64<BR>Lovem - 61<BR>Hedonista - 55<BR>Emmajo - 65<BR>Tearem - 61<BR>Perragon - 60<BR>Duktak - 59<BR>Zorin - 63<BR>Bamgoo - 43</P>
<P>Congrats to the winners!</P>
<P>One last piece of news.. and equally important is that our resident enchanter Brytelyte (ah nostalgia) completed his Staff of the Serpent!! Congratulations!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Mar 14, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 12, 2004 :: Ok ok.. catching up!</div><P>Aerin'Dar died again, but this time there were no paladin toys! Grats Kasserole on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/valorious_quarterstaff.jpg">Valorious Quarterstaff</A> and Barell on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wrath_of_Mithanial.jpeg">Wrath of Mithaniel</A>! Was clearly staff day </P>
<P>Somehow I missed updating the mighty Zorholio and his cleric epic. So, it's a week or two late, but Grats Zorin on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/water_sprinkler_of_nem_ankh.jpg">Water Sprinkler</A>! I'll have to get a picture and add it.. without pants of course! </P>
<P>Killed the mama snake and the papa snake, baby snake was already dead, of course. Grats to Shatta on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/scalemesh_leggings.jpg">Scale Mesh Leggings</A>, Duktak on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics18/Pristine_Jade_Idol.JPG">Pristine Jade Idol</A>, Schena on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/sleeves_of_elemental_auras.jpg">Sleeves of Elemental Auras</A> and Greylok on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/lava_infused_bludgeon.jpg">Lava Infused Bludgeon</A>!&nbsp;&nbsp; </P>
<P>Grabbed a couple of Tower bosses and got Jumped a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/greatstaff_of_the_four_winds.jpg">Greatstaff of the Four Winds</A>, Moordread on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wand_of_the_Ice_Storm.gif">Wand of the Ice Storm</A> and Lairiel and Jakr both got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Mantle_of_the_Rainmaker.jpg">Mantle of the Rainmaker</A>. And a rune for Colwn. </P>
<P>Grats Tearem on 61! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 10, 2004 :: Bombur gets second Zerker epic on Povar!</div><P>Thanks all for the help getting the little dwarfie his epic! Myseriously, despite all the time we spent in Wars Woods tracking for something, slaughtering, etc, it suddenly appeared after the patch today. I'm sure we're all just morons and missed it.. yah.. right.. <BR><BR>Second on Povar! <BR>Kerasian Axe of Ire<BR>2H Slashing<BR>46/37<BR>AC:5<BR>Effect: Rage of Keras (Worn) +40 attack 40% haste<BR>STR: 15&nbsp; DEX: 15 STA: 20 HP: 125&nbsp; ENDURANCE: 100 SV FIRE:8&nbsp; SV DISEASE: 10 SVCOLD: 15 SVMAGIC: 7 SVPOISON: 10</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/bomepic.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR>Particle effects are on the new graphic engine.. so there is nothing to see until that's added to the game. </P>
<P>Grats Emmajo on 65!<BR>Grats Ashpaw on 64!<BR>Grats Lovem on 60!<BR>Grats Dawney and Shatta on 56!<BR>Grats Papa on Marshall!</P>
<P>Wil update the stuff and drops later... </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 10, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 5, 2004 :: BoT Tower Bosses</div><P>Decided to head on up and kill those Mini Bosses in BoT! Grats Balut on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wand_of_the_Ice_Storm.gif">Wand of the Ice Storm</A>, Druentia on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/wanderers_sylvan_tunic.jpg">Wanderer's Sylvan Tunic</A>, Bukowski on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/cap_drowned_souls.jpg">Cap of Drowned Souls</A>, Thayet and Neola on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/stormriders_signet.jpg">Stormrider's Signets</A>, Arglar won the greed roll for an ornate chain breastplate mold and Druentia, Punkgurl and Parnicail all got a Rune! </P>
<P>Um... some folks leveled in the past couple days I haven't been on... pretty sure that's true.. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 2, 2004 :: Ring War for BOB!!</div><P>Grats BOB on your shiny new Ring of Dain Frostweaver... maybe Jakr will get to use it now and again too! And grats to Emmajo on the Crown of Narandi, Tankorr on the Choker of the Wretched and some other people on the other stuff! </P>
<P>Grats Emmajo on 63!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 62!<BR>Grats Scheni on 60 and Phantasmist! <BR>Grats Lovem on 59!<BR>Grats Puven on 41!</P>
<P>(edit)</P>
<P>As part of me losin yet another blasted&nbsp;bet I am bein forced ta use me art work for evil and was told ta draws how I saw the fight ta get that cat his ring... here be the pic I hope ya be happy...</P>
<P><IMG alt=Bah! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/arglar/narandi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Arglar on Mar 4, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 1, 2004 :: Grats Zorin on your water sprinkler!</div><P>A rare, relatively low LD, Zorin appearance happened late last night so we grabbed a couple people and killed Ragefire for him! After not too many LDs, he finished his hand in and got his clicky stick! Grats Z! </P>
<P>Grats Punkgurl on 65 and Lady Protector!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=3'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a> <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a> 4 <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> <a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=5'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
